# Post-battle briefing.
<machine_speech><gray>Battle log — outcome: <shining>{result}<\shining>. Duration {ticks} ticks. Own losses {lost}. Enemy destroyed {killed}. Fleet strength {ships}.<\gray>
?if result = victory
<gray>Two adversaries, one survivor: you. They spent themselves on each other.<\gray>
?else
<gray>They did not spend themselves as hoped. Consider what each one could reach before committing.<\gray>
?end
